								Gao et al., Table 3. Output-token multipliers assume optimistic
								context reuse across agents; without it they would be higher. AIME's
								220× comes from repeated full-context debate rounds on long
								solutions. Note that on GSM8K, DS-1000 and BigCodeBench the MAS
								being paid for is actually <em>less</em> accurate than SAS.
							</figcaption>
