					<div class="prose">
						<p>
							The most satisfying experiment is the boundary condition the theory
							predicted. Degrade the context — delete, mask, or substitute a
							fraction α of its tokens — and the DPI guarantee no longer applies,
							because the single agent no longer sees the true C. If MAS structure
							genuinely filters and recovers signal, this is exactly where it
							should start winning. It does:
						</p>
